Package: sdmhelpers
Title: Helper Functions for Species Distribution Modelling
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
      given = "Andris",
      family = "Avotins",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "avotins.puces@gmail.com",
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8582-0822")
    )
Description: Provides helper functions for species distribution modelling
    workflows, including spatial and temporal kernel density estimation,
    circular phenology weighting, temporal overlap estimation, spatial-fold
    selection, and threshold-based model evaluation. The package is intended
    to support reproducible preparation and evaluation of ecological models. It 
    was developed in project “HiQBioDiv: High-resolution quantification of 
    biodiversity for conservation and management” funded by the Latvian Council 
    of Science (Ref. No. VPP-VARAM-DABA-2024/1-0002).
